{"type":"text","timestamp":1794529135646,"sessionID":"ses_e2dbc3be8ffeZjZZx7Vqdb573y","part":{"id":"prt_1d2457d87002ONmJidUCoIsKVM","sessionID":"ses_e2dbc3be8ffeZjZZx7Vqdb573y","messageID":"msg_1d2455c97001IotSdHabXL766X","type":"text","text":"T019 is complete. Here is the report.\n\n## Files written\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs` (`R`) — two changes only:\n  1. Added `import { briefDelivered, replayOffer } from './command-offer.mjs';`\n  2. In `runTurn`: resolved the locator once into a local (used by both the line and the brief reader), then after the restore and before `appendRunLine`, called `replayOffer({ checkoutDir: PROJECT_DIR, prompt: job.prompt, sessionId })`, added `offeredCommand` and `offeredPolicy` to the appended line, and added `briefDelivered` from that locator, forced to `\"unknown\"` on a dry run. The `headMoved` early-append path and every other turn step are untouched.\n\nNo other file was edited, and the `tasks.md` checkbox was left unticked.\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n$ node --check .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nexit=0\n\n$ rg -c \"offeredCommand|offeredPolicy|briefDelivered\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\n5\n\n$ node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs --print-argv claude | jq -r 'type'\narray\n```\n\nAll three expectations hold: exit 0, 5 matching lines (≥ 3), and `array`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- The working-tree diff for `R` also shows a pre-existing DSH change (lineage patch removed, replaced by the comment about fan-out leaves) that was already present when I read the file. I did not touch or revert it.\n- I did not exercise a live or dry-run turn, since the task's verify commands do not request one and a dry run would invoke the Claude prompt hook.\n- Nothing in the task could not be done.","time":{"start":1794529131911,"end":1794529135646}}}
